The Two-Column Relationship
On desktop, the rooms section and the booking summary exist in a two-column layout:
- Left column (65%): Room cards, scrollable — renders website content merged with API data
- Right column (35%): Booking summary, sticky — renders API data (pricing, totals)
This is the single most important layout decision on the page. It ensures:
- The user always sees their selection and total
- Price transparency is maintained at every scroll position
- The "Proceed to Booking" CTA is always accessible
- The cognitive gap between "selecting" and "seeing the price" is zero
