│  │ ☐  Bonfire Evening                     │  │
│  │    Private setup              +₹1,200  │  │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
Package Interaction
- Tapping a package toggles it
- The booking summary updates immediately (no lag) — calls POST /quote with updated selection
- Included packages cannot be deselected
- Maximum 4–5 packages per room (API constraint)
10. Booking Summary Design
Source: InnPilot API (pricing) + User Selection (dates, guests, packages)
Desktop: Sticky Sidebar
The booking summary is the most persistent element on the page. It is always visible once a room is selected.
