Summary Line Items
Every pricing line item comes directly from the InnPilot API. The frontend does not compute any monetary values.
Line  Source  Display
Room name Website content (selected room) / API (fallback)  "The Forest Suite"
Dates User selection  "Jul 25 – Jul 28, 2026"
Nights  Calculated from dates (simple subtraction, not money) "3 nights"
Guests  User selection  "2 Adults, 1 Child"
Room cost InnPilot API nightly_rate × nights (display only) "₹21,000"
Package costs InnPilot API package prices "Nature Photo Walk +₹1,500"
Subtotal  InnPilot API subtotal "₹22,500"
Taxes InnPilot API taxes  "Taxes (12%) ₹2,700"
Discount  InnPilot API discount (if any)  "Discount -₹1,000" (green)
Grand total InnPilot API grand_total  "₹25,200" (bold, large)
Summary States
State Content
No room selected  "Select a room to see pricing" — placeholder message
Room selected, API pending  Room name from website content (or API), skeleton shimmer for all price lines
Room selected, API responded  Room name, dates, guests, room total, taxes, grand total
Room + packages All above plus package line items
With discount Discount line in green with strikethrough on original
API error "Unable to load pricing. Please try again." with retry button
