Comparison Data Sources
Field Source  Enhancement Level If Missing
Presentation area Website content Enhancement Omitted; comparison still functional
Room name Website content / API fallback  Critical  Name from API displayed
Per-night rate  InnPilot API  Critical  Always available after API response
Bed type  Website content Enhancement Row omitted from comparison
Room area Website content Enhancement Row omitted from comparison
Occupancy Website content Enhancement Row omitted from comparison
Amenities Website content Enhancement Amenities section omitted from comparison
Select button Functional  Critical  Always rendered
The comparison view adapts to whatever data is available. It never shows empty rows or "N/A" placeholders for missing presentation data. It simply omits rows where data is absent.
18. Policies
Merged Source: Website Content + InnPilot
Policies combine editorial content from the website with operational rules from InnPilot.
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  What to Know                                 │
│                                              │
│  ▸ Check-in & Check-out                      │
│    Check-in: 2:00 PM · Check-out: 11:00 AM  │
│    (InnPilot data, displayed in website      │
│     editorial format)                        │
│                                              │
│  ▸ Cancellation Policy                       │
│    Free cancellation up to 48 hours before   │
│    check-in. Cancellations within 48 hours   │
│    are subject to a one-night charge.        │
│    (InnPilot rules, expressed in website     │
